OL,3,CWatch the solar eclipse live across
OL,4,Cthe North East and North Yorkshire
OL,6,FAmy Lea presents a special live
OL,7,Fprogramme as we join people watching
OL,8,Fthe solar eclipse in Gateshead,
OL,9,FNorthumberland and Whitby
OL,11,FWatch a special programme from ITV
OL,12,FNews Tyne Tees as the North East and
OL,13,FNorth Yorkshire experiences a once-in-
OL,14,Fa-generation solar eclipse.
OL,16,FAmy Lea and Ross Hutchinson are at a
OL,17,Fmajor watch party in Gateshead -
OL,18,F'Eclipse on The Tyne' in Baltic Square.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
