OL,3,CWatch the solar eclipse live across
OL,4,Cthe North East and North Yorkshire
OL,6,FGregg Easteal is joining eclipse
OL,7,Fwatchers at the Twice Brewed Inn near
OL,8,FHexham.
OL,10,FAnd, Rachel Bullock is in Whitby, the
OL,11,Ffirst place an eclipse was formally
OL,12,Frecorded back in 644 AD.
OL,14,FMore details about the timings and
OL,15,Fexpected weather conditions for the
OL,16,Fsolar eclipse can be found here.
