OL,3,CWatch the solar eclipse live across
OL,4,Cthe North East and North Yorkshire
OL,6,FPlease remember not to look directly
OL,7,Fat the sun during the solar eclipse
OL,8,Funless you have special eclipse
OL,9,Fglasses, as it could permanently
OL,10,Fdamage your eyes - normal sunglasses
OL,11,For looking through a camera or phone
OL,12,Fwill not offer enough protection.
